#: bell.cpp:77
msgid "Bell Settings"
msgstr "klok instellings"

#: bell.cpp:88
msgid "&Use System Bell instead of System Notification"
msgstr "gebruik stelsel klok in plaas van van stelsel inkennisstelling"

#: bell.cpp:89
msgid ""
"You can use the standard system bell (PC speaker) or a more sophisticated "
"system notification, see the \"System Notifications\" control module for the "
"\"Something Special Happened in the Program\" event."
msgstr ""
"jy kan gebruik die standaard stelsel klok (pc luidspreker) of 'n meer "
"gesofistikeerd stelsel inkennisstelling, sien die \"stelsel "
"inkennistelling\" kontrole module vir die \"iets spesiaal het gebeur in die "
"program\" gebeurtenis."

#: bell.cpp:98
msgid "&Volume:"
msgstr "volume:"

#: bell.cpp:103
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the volume of the system bell. For further "
"customization of the bell, see the \"Accessibility\" control module."
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan pasmaak die volume van die stelsel klok. vir verdere pasmaking "
"van die klok, sien die \"toeganklikheid\" kontrole module."

#: bell.cpp:107
msgid "&Pitch:"
msgstr "toonhoogte:"

#: bell.cpp:109
msgid "Hz"
msgstr "hz"

#: bell.cpp:112
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the pitch of the system bell. For further "
"customization of the bell, see the \"Accessibility\" control module."
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan pasmaak die toonhoogte van die stelsel klok. vir verdere "
"pasmaking van die klok, sien die \"toeganklikheid\" kontrole module."

#: bell.cpp:116
msgid "&Duration:"
msgstr "duur:"

#: bell.cpp:118
msgid "ms"
msgstr "mev"

#: bell.cpp:121
msgid ""
"Here you can customize the duration of the system bell. For further "
"customization of the bell, see the \"Accessibility\" control module."
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan pasmaak die duur van die stelsel klok. vir verdere pasmaking van "
"die klok, sien die \"toeganklikheid\" kontrole module."

#: bell.cpp:125
msgid "&Test"
msgstr "toets"

#: bell.cpp:129
msgid ""
"Click \"Test\" to hear how the system bell will sound using your changed "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"kliek \"toets\" aan hoor hoe die stelsel klok sal klank te gebruik jou het "
"verander instellings."

#: bell.cpp:228
msgid ""
"<h1>System Bell</h1>"
" Here you can customize the sound of the standard system bell, i.e. the "
"\"beep\" you always hear when there's something wrong. Note that you can "
"further customize this sound using the \"Accessibility\" control module: for "
"example you can choose a sound file to be played instead of the standard "
"bell."
msgstr ""

